1 2 [c] An HCP, a patient, and an administrator are all registered in the iTrust2 system. An iTrust2 user is logged into the system. The HCP must have begun documenting an office visit.
2 3 [s] hcp The HCP selects the name of the prescription from a list. There is no option to enter names not tracked by the system.
3 4 [e] system displays a success message and logs transaction
4 5 [c] System processes request successfully and logs transaction.
